### Check first
Open [this component](/#/components/{{componentUrnForUrl}}/highlights) and its [metrics](/#/components/{{componentUrnForUrl}}/metrics). Inspect failed model-call traces, error.type and the exact provider endpoint. The configured threshold is **{{threshold}}** in the monitor chart's unit.

### Likely causes
Authentication, rate limits, timeouts, unavailable models or endpoint errors.

### Fix
Correct the observed error cause and retry the same caller/provider/model endpoint.

### Verify
The error ratio falls below the threshold with actual request traffic; no traffic is not a successful request. If samples are absent, investigate the exporter and Collector: this threshold check cannot establish healthy operation without data.
